@api.fullstack_HostAddress = http://localhost:5286

### Search posts by title (grouped by user)
GET {{api.fullstack_HostAddress}}/Post/search?q=qui
Accept: application/json

### No matches -> empty array
GET {{api.fullstack_HostAddress}}/Post/search?q=zzzz
Accept: application/json

### Missing term -> 400 Bad Request
GET {{api.fullstack_HostAddress}}/Post/search?q=
Accept: application/json

###
